<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 Timothy</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timothy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I hundampa Pasien le i lamet pa uh Khris Jesu thupiehna tawh Jesu Khris’ sawltahpi keima Paul in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />upna sungah ka ta tahtah ahi Timothy tungah: Pa Pasien le i Topa Jesu Khris kung panin hepina, khuotuona le lungnopna om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Macedonia gam lam manaw-in ka pei lai-a kang gensa ma bangin Ephesus khuo-ah tam inlen, mi pawlkhat in thuhilna dang khatpo a hil lo nading ule,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />upna tawh a kithei Pasien’ vaihawmna ahi lo, kinielna a piengsah thei phuotawm tangmite le mong nei lo khanggui ciemtena po-ah amate a kipumpieh lo nadingun thu na hil thei nadingin kang hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam bang thuhilna’ a tupna pen lungsim siengtho, ei le ei kitheina hoi, le upna tahtah pana a pei itna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua itna panin mi pawlkhatte pielmangin a khietna nei lo holimna lamah a kihei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a thugente ule kiptaha a thugente uh telsiem lopi-in Pasien’ thukham hil sie po a suoh nuom na lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in mi khat in thukham pen ahi banga a zah nah leh hoi hi, ci i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami a ci nopna in thukham pen midihte dinga kibawl ahi sih a, thukham palsatte le thu mang lote, Pasien mi ahi lote le mawneite, a siengtho lote le mi thanghuoite, a nu a pa thatte, tuolthatte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nu le pa mawna a bawlte, pasal le pasal mawna a bawlte, sila zua-a sum bawlte, zuouthu gente, zuouthu tawh a kiciemte a kipanin thuhilna a man tawh a kilebul mite dinga kibawl ahi hi, ci theisiemna ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua pen thupha tawh a kidim a minthang Pasien in keima ei kepsah lungdamna thu tawh a kituoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama’ nasem dingin keima ei se a, mi muonhuoi bangin ei ngaisun ahi ziehin i Topa Jesu Khris tungah ka lung a dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Masang lai-in migensie pa, mi bawlsie pa, le mi ngongtat pa ka hi vangin, uplana zieh le theilana zieha a gamta ka hi ziehin khuotuona ka nga a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khris Jesu sunga a om upna le itna tawh kei adingin i Topa’ hepina a dimlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khris Jesu in mawneite hundam dingin leitungah ang pei hi, ci-a kigen pen a man hi a, a unpi-in san dingin kilawm hi, tua mawneite lahah kei a siehuoi pen ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua thu hang ma-in ama umin kumtawm hinna a nga ding mite’ ette thei dingin Jesu Khris in a gilo pen keima sungah ahi theina za tawh lungduoina ei lah thei nadingin khuotuona ka nga zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A si thei lo, a kimu thei lo, le ama beh Pasien ahi, kumtawn Kumpipa tungah patawina le minthanna om zing taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ta Timothy aw, keima in masang lai-a nang tawh kisai genkholna thute tawh kizui-in tami thuhilna kang pie hi. Tua thute zui-in gal dona pha na do thei nadingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />upna le kitheina lungsim hoi nei in. A sie le a pha theina lungsim a nuol ziehun mi pawlkhatte in tembaw kisie bangin a upna uh a kisiesah vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />amate lahah Pasien gensiet lo nading a sin dingin Satan tunga ka apsa Hymenaeus le Alexander-te kihal uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin amasa penin note in mi zosie ading ngetnate, thungetnate, thumpiehnate le lungdamkonate na bawl ding uh kang hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eite in Pasien’ mi hina le zatah huoina ah lungmuong tah le kilem tahin i hinkhuo i man thei nadingun kumpite le thunei zosiete adingin thu ngetpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam pen thudih ahi a, eite’ hundam pa Pasien muna-ah a sanhuoi suohin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mi vannuoi in hutdamna nga-in, thuman thutah a theikim ding uh ama in a dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien khat beh a om hi; Pasien le mihingte kikalah zong palai khat beh om a, tua khu mihing ma ahi Khris Jesu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in mi zosie tat nadingin ama le ama kipie a, tua teci panna thu pen a hun lienin kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami adingin keima tangko pa le sawltahpi dingin ei kise zo a, (zuouthu gen loin thutah a gen ka hi hi), kei pen upna le thutah ah Gentile-te’ siepa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin mun zosie-a om pasalte in lungthah kisel cite om loin khut siengthote lamto-in thu a nget ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ma bangin numeite zong opdan siemin puonsil nihten a kituoh a kilawm tawh kizem uheh, samtumna, ahi sihle ngun le kham le puon manham pipite tawh kizepnate nei loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien ka zatah hi, a ci numeite dinga a kilawm pen ahi nasep hoite tawh kizemzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Numei in thumanna bukim tawh sip dide-in thu sin ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numei in pasal tungah thuhilin uhna aana a nei ding ka phal sih hi; ama pen a sip dide ding ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Adam kipiengsah masa a, tua zaw ciengin Eve kipiengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Adam na kisol lo a, numei na kisolin mawnei na suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle numei in opdan siemin upna, itna, le siengthona a nei suoh po leh nau neina tungtawnin ama hutdamin a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi khatpo in hlattuom pawlpi sie panmun a lunggul leh nasep thupi sem nuom ahi hi, ci-a na kigen khu thuman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpi kem siepa pen genbang lo mi, zi khat beh a nei mi, a kideh zo mi, a pilvang mi, a zatahhuoi mi, zindo siem mi, thuhil siem mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />zukham lo mi, ngongtat loin a nunnem mi, mi tawh a kihau nuom lo mi, le sumlepai lamah a duhop lo mi hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A innkuon sungah vaihawm siem ding a, sil bangkimah zatahna tawh a tate a thunungsah mi hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khat in ama’ innkuon sung vaihawm zie ding a thei sih leh Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpi bangci kep thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama pen a piengtha cil mi hi lo ding hi, tua hi sihle ama kiphasahin dawimangpa ma bangin thukhenna a thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua tham loin a mindai lo nading le dawimangpa’ thangah a aw lo nadingin a pulam mite’ zatah mi hi pelmaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ma bangin upa dingte zong a zatahhuoi mi, thu a legen kawikawi lo mi, zu hai lo mi, sumlepai lamah a huoiham lo mi hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amate in kitheina lungsim siengtho tawh upna thuthuh tukip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A masa-in amate kisittel phot uheh; tua zaw ciengin amau le amau genbang lo a kisah uleh upa sem ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ma bangin numeite zong a zatahhuoi mi, mi gensiet hat lo mi, sil bangkimah pilvangin a muonhuoi mi hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpi upate pen zi khat beh nei mi hi hinlen, a tate le a innkuonpite hoitahin uh ta uheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />azieh pen hlattuom pawlpi upa hoitaha a semte in mite’ zatahna nga a, Khris Jesu sunga a om upna thu ah zong hangsanna lienpi nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kung vuah ang haw bai dingin ka kilamen a, ahi vangin na kung vuah tam thuhilnate kang giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kang kiheh khah tah lezong note in thuman thutah’ khuompi le bulkip ahi a hingzing Pasien’ innkuon sungah bangci gamtat ding ci thu na thei ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Upla huoi lo a lien mama i biehna thuthuhpi in: Tahsa-in ama hing kilangin, hlagau sungah dih hi, ci-in na kilah a, vantung mite in mu-in, Gentile-te lahah kitangko a, leitung muncin tengah ki-umin, minthanna tawh ama kilato hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Hlagau in kicientahin a gen thu in, hun nukhia ciengin mi pawlkhat in upna thu taisanin zuou thei hlagaute’ thugen le dawite’ thuhilnate a mang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam banga thuhilna pen sia-emsa tawh a lungsim uh a kihalgawsa zuou thugente’ kineitawmna tungtawna ang pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in kiten kipinate a kham vua, thuman thutah thei-in a um mite in lungdamkona tawh a san zieu ding vua Pasien in a piensah ante a tan nadingun thu a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien’ piensah na vannuoi hoi a, lungdam kona tawh a kisan nah leh niel ding khat zong a om sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile tuate pen Pasien’ kammal le thungetna tawh a kisiengsahsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na zuisa upna thu le thuhilna hoite tawh kiva-in sanggamte kungah tami kithuhilnate na gen nah leh Khris Jesu nasem hoi khat na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien’ thu tawh a kituoh lo a mothuoi tangmite le pivuoite’ gen tangmite tawh kisaw kha sin. Pasien’ mi hina lamah nang le nang kisin in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile pumpi kisinna in phattuomna pawlkhat nei a, ahi vangin Pasien’ mi hina in tuhun hinkhuo ding le ang tung ding hinkhuo adingin kamciem a nei ziehin na zosie ah a manpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami pen a buppi-in san dinga a kilawm a muonhuoi thu kigen khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen eite in mi zosie, a diehdiehin a um mite’ Hundampa tungah i lametna uh i koi ziehun, tami thu-ah na semin nahpi tahin i hanciem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami thute hil inlen na hawmsawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koima in na khangnona kisimmaw sah sinlen, kamhamna, gamtatna, itna, upna le siengthona lamah thu um mite ette dingin na om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kang pei masangin mipite mai-ah Lai Siengtho simna, hanthotna le thuhilnate na pawnthaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kamsanna tungtawnin upate in khutngahna tawh na tunga ang kipie letsong thudon loin om sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi zosie in na khantona a mu thei nadingin tami thute-ah nang mama kipumpiehin kisin in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang mama kikepsiemin na thuhilnate-ah pilvangin; tami thute zomsuoh in, bangzieh ahei cile tam banga na bawlna ziehin nangma le na thugen a za mite na hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang sanga a khanghamzawte khautahin hopi sinlen, pa bangin hopi zaw in. A khangdawng zawte zong sanggam bangin hopi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siengthona tahtah tawh a tazaw numeite na nu bang in hopi inlen, a khangdawng zaw numeite sanggam nu bangin hopi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meigong tahtahte na zatah bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Meigong khat in tate ahi a, tute ahi zongin a nei leh a nu a pate tungah lungdam a thuhkia thei nadingin a innkuon sung vuah a biehna utawh kisai a mawpuohna uh sin masa phot uheh; bangzieh ahei cile tami in Pasien a lungkimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kem a khoi ding om loin ama tanga kinuasie meigong tahtah numei nu in Pasien tungah a lametna nga a, sun le zanin thu ngetna le thumna nei ngitnget hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahi vangin noptatna lamah a nungta numei nu ahile a hin sung nangawnin a si zo ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a kimawsiet thei lo nadingin amate tungah tam thute gen sawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi khatpo in a tanaute, a diehdiehin a innkuonpite a va nuom sih leh upna thu niel ahi a, thu um lo mipa sanga a siezaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meigong numei khat kum sawmguh sangin tawm zaw loin, khatvei beh pasal nei ngaisa ahile meigong sazien sungah khumsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama pen a gamtat hoina zieha phatna a nga mi, a tate mi suo-in zindo a siem mi hi ding a, mi siengthote’ keng silpiehin, cimaw dongtuohte khoi a, vai zosie-ah na hoi sem dinga ama le ama a kipumpieh mi hi teitei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin khangdawng meigongte ahile sazien sunga khum ding niel un; azieh pen a si le sa lunggulna uh khangin pasal a nei nuom kia ciengun Khris a taisan vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaci’n a kamciemna masa uh a palsat ziehun amate in mawsah thukhenna a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua banah amate in bangma sem loin hun mawh tawpsah ding sinin, inn khat zaw inn khat pei kawikawi-in a vah thapai vua, tuaci’n a hun mawh tawpsah beh hi loin mi gensiet hatin, mi dangte’ thu-ah kikumthaw-in gen dinga kilawm lo thute a gen lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin i langpa’ ei gensiet nading a op lo nadingin khangdawng meigongte in pasal nei-in ta le nau nei a, a inn sung a vaihawm ding ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Satan nua zui dingin pawlkhat a lampiel zo tazaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu um numei khatpo in meigong tahtah tanaute a nei leh amate panpi taheh; tuaci’n hlattuom pawlpite vangih suon loin meigong tahtahte kipanpi thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu vaihawm siem ahi hlattuom pawlpi upate, a diehdiehin thugenna le thuhilna lamah a kukalte pen patawina a za ni pieh dingin kilawm hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />azieh pen Lai Siengtho in, “Bawngtang in bu a cil laitahin a nephu na tuom sih ding uhi,” ci a, tua ciengin, “Nasem pa in a thaman a nga ding kilawm hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Upa khat mawsah nadingin mi ni ahi sihle thum in teci a pan lo buong le thulah ngai sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mawna a bawl paupaute tawh kisai-in adangte a zau thei nadingin mi zosie mai-ah na phawhsie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huptuom paituom le khentuom nei loin tami thuhilnate na zui nadingin Pasien mai, Khris Jesu mai le a kiteel vantung mite mai-ah thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi khatpo tungah na khut nga-in kipsah paipai sin; midangte mawna-ah kihal loin nang le nang a siengtho-in kikem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na gilpi ading le na cinat paipai nate a dam thei nadingin tuisih beh dawn nawn sinlen, lenggazu zong tawmtawm na dawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawlkhatte’ mawna pen kilang pai a, thukhenna ah tuate a na matun zo hi, midangte’ mawna in tuate a nuazui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin gamtatna hoite zong a kilang pai sinsen hi; a kilang lote nangawn zong kiphuol suoh zo tuon lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ min le thuhilna a kigensiet lo nadingin sila hahkol nei-a a om zosiete in a pute tungah zatahna zosie pieh tah hi, ci-in ngaisun uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu um mi pu-a a neite in hlattuom pawlpi mi ahina hang utawh amate zatah loin om tuon sih uheh; amau’ nasepna a phattuompite pen thu um mite le a itte uh ma ahi ziehin a hoizaw sema amau’ na a seppieh ding uh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami tavuonte hilin na hansuo ding hi. Pasien’ mi hina tawh kituohin a siengtho i Topa Jesu Khris’ thute le thuhilna a sang thei lo mi poma pen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kihisah ahi a, bangma thei lo mi ahi hi. Tua bang mi poma thu kiselna le kinielna lamah lunggulna man lo a neite ahi uhi. Tua teng panin kithangsietna, kihauna, kigensietna, a hoi lo lama ki-upmawnate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />le lungsim sie nei-in thuman thutah a pom lo, Pasien’ mi hina pen hau theina ding lampi-a a ngaisun mite lahah kihau kiselna lienpi a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungkimna tawh a kikop Pasien’ mi hina pen metna lienpi hi tahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile eite in leitungah bangma i keng sih vua, tua panin zong bangma i puo thei sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hizongle anneh ding le puonsil ding i nei nah po leh tuate tawh i lungkim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin a hau nuom mite pen ze-etna sungah a pua vua, a motvai le a siesah thei lunggulna tampite sungah awhcipin, tuate in sietna le suhsietna sungah a lutpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile sum deigawna in sietna namkim’ zungpi hi a, a hau nop luotna ziehun upna panin mi pawlkhat pielin lungkhamna tampi a thuohlaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle Pasien’ mipa aw, nang in tam thu zosie na pel in; dihna, Pasien’ mi hina, upna, itna, thuohzawhna, le lungnemna na del in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Upna galdona hoi na do in; kumtawn hinna na tukip in, tami dinga ang kihlan ahi a, nang in teci tampite mai-ah a hoi pulahna na bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na zosie tungah hinna a pie pa Pasien mai le Pontius Pilat mai-ah pulahna hoi bawlin teci a pang pa Khris Jesu’ mit mu-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />i Topa Jesu Khris ang kilahkia masangsie mawsahna le genbanna om loin a thupiehte na zui nadingin thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpite’ Kumpi, topate’ Topa , thupha nga-in Thunei pen pa ahi ama beh in hun a sah ciengin ang piengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama beh a si thei lo le a kineh thei lo khuovah sunga a teng pa hi a, koima in ama mu ngai loin zong mu thei lo hi; ama tungah patawina le kumtawn uhna om taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu huna mihaute ahile kisathei loin a kicien lo haunate tungah a lametna uh zong nga loin, i lungnop thei nadingin sil bangkim kicing taha ei sih pa Pasien tungah a ngah zawh nadingun amate thu pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in sil hoi bawlin a pha tampi sem a, a neisate uh phalna tawh mi a hop thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ang tung ding hun adingin amate mama in tua bangin bulkip hoi gougil khat khol uheh, tua hile amate in tua hinna tahtah a tukip thei ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Timothy aw, nang tunga ang ki-apsa thute kemsiem in. A siengtho lo kamham le a man lopi-a thu theina a kici kiniel kiselnate na pel in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile mi pawlkhatte in tua bang pilna nei-in a kingaisut ziehun upna laigil panin a pielmang ta uhi. Note tawh hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
